e>1757</volume> <fpage>467</fpage>-473<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16781660</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="N0x48f1620N0x3e45db8"><label>21</label><citation citation-type="journal">Kiritoshi, S., Nishikawa, T., Sonoda, K., Kukidome, D., Senokuchi, T., Matsuo, T., Matsumura, T., Tokunaga, H., Brownlee, M., and Araki, E. (<year>2003</year>) <source>Diabetes</source> <volume>52</volume> <fpage>2570</fpage>-2577<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14514642</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="N0x48f1620N0x3e46040"><label>22</label><citation citation-type="journal">Lee, K. U., Lee, I. K., Han, J., Song, D. K., Kim, Y. M., Song, H. S., Kim, H. S., Lee, W. J., Koh, E. H., Song, K. H., Han, S. M., Kim, M. S., Park, I. S., and Park, J. Y. (<year>2005</year>) <source>Circ. Res.</source> <volume>96</volume> <fpage>1200</fpage>-1207<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15905464</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="N0x48f1620N0x3e462c8"><label>23</label><citation citation-type="journal">Li, L. X., Skorpen, F., Egeberg, K., Jorgensen, I. H., and Grill, V. (<year>2001</year>) <source>Biochem. Biophys. Res. Commun.</source> <volume>282</volume> <fpage>273</fpage>-277<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11264003</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="N0x48f1620N0x3e46550"><label>24</label><citation citation-type="journal">Nishikawa, T., Edelstein, D., Du, X. L., Yamagishi, S., Matsumura, T., Kaneda, Y., Yorek, M. A., Beebe, D., Oates, P. J., Hammes, H. P., Giardino, I., and Brownlee, M. (<year>2000</year>) <source>Nature</source> <volume>404</volume> <fpage>787</fpage>-790<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10783895</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref25"><label>25</label><citation citation-type="journal">Anderson, E. J., Yamazaki, H., and Neufer, P. D. (<year>2007</year>) <source>J. Biol. Chem.</source> <volume>282</volume> <fpage>31257</fpage>-31266<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17761668</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="ref26"><label>26</label><citation citation-type="journal">Votyakova, T. V., and Reynolds, I. J. (<year>2004</year>